# cliproxyapi: standalone OAuth-subscription proxy (ChatGPT Codex / Gemini
# / Claude / Grok). NOT a LiteLLM consumer — its a sibling api_base that
# LiteLLMs cliproxy/* model_list entries point at.
SERVICE_RUNNER=docker
SERVICE_DESC="OAuth-subscription proxy (ChatGPT/Gemini/Claude/Grok via cliproxy/*)"
SERVICE_STACK_ENV='
# Client key (LiteLLM cliproxy/* model_list entries authenticate with this).
# Management key gates the management/OAuth-login web panel. Both
# gen-once via `just setup`; rotating either requires a container restart
# and (for CLIPROXY_API_KEY) re-rendering litellms config.runtime.yaml.
CLIPROXY_API_KEY=
CLIPROXY_MANAGEMENT_KEY=
# Pinned image tag — bump deliberately.
CLIPROXY_VERSION=v7.1.11
'
